    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.comment\n\n### Question\n\ni want to comment and uncomment a empty line ,but how to config ?\r\ntry `ignore_blank_line` false and true no work",
